OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with sunny spells initially.
OL,7,FCloud slowly builds from the west
OL,8,Fovernight but many areas remaining dry
OL,9,Fand clear. Feeling cool overnight,
OL,10,Fparticularly for rural areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA bright start for areas,
OL,13,Fcloud developing more widely in the
OL,14,Fnorth of region through the day but
OL,15,Fremaining dry with good sunny spells.
OL,16,FFeeling warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
